        This project visualizes and evaluates the potential for Direct Air Capture (DAC) technologies across German counties using a variety of environmental, infrastructural and economic criteria.
    </p>
    <NavLink class="hover-frame" href="/statistiken" style="margin-top: 30px; display: inline-block; background-color: white; color: #003C78; padding: 12px 24px; font-weight: bold; border-radius: 8px; text-decoration: none; font-size: 16px; box-shadow: 0 3px 6px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);">
