        <div class="hover-frame" style="width: 400px; background: white; border-radius: 12px; padding: 20px; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(0,0,0,0.1); flex-shrink: 0;">
            <h3 style="color: #005EA8;">CO₂ Price</h3>
